---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Chips from '../components/Chips.astro';
import avatar from '../assets/images/avatar.jpg';
import { getResume } from '../lib/resume';

const { basics, interests } = await getResume();

const goals = ['Finish sorting Irish FBR', 'Lose weight', 'Blog Improvements'];
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle="About" ogType="article">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="about">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2 id="blog">Blog</h2>
    <p>This is my blog about tech and music and whatever else crosses my mind. It was written to be a personal log of my thoughts, a journal for my hobbies, a place to place notes on research and tech I study while working, and a place to put down ideas on self improvement.</p>

    <p>There are no rules about what I post, the above was the intent when I started this project but I have decided that I will not allow that to stop me writing a post if I think that it will help me or others.</p>

    <h2 id="me">Me</h2>
    <div class="avatar-box">
      <!-- Click it a few times; see fun.ts -->
      <button type="button" class="avatar" data-coffee-avatar aria-label="Poke the unicorn">
        <Image src={avatar} width={128} height={128} densities={[1, 2]} alt="" />
      </button>
      <p class="coffee-bubble" hidden>NEED MORE COFFEE <span aria-hidden="true">☕</span></p>
    </div>
    <p>Hi, I am me. I am a human in my late 30s. I enjoy many hobbies including astrophotography, archery, bbqs, calligraphy, drawing, listening to music, playing music, board games, video games, reading, table top role playing games, and many others. I live by myself in a small village in the eastern UK, I like the quiet and the lack of light pollution for my stargazing.</p>

    <h2 id="work">Work</h2>
    <p>{basics.summary}</p>
    <p>You can read more on my <a href="/resume/">resume</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="prose">
    <h2 id="current-goals">Current Goals</h2>
    <ul class="goals">
      {goals.map((goal) => <li>{goal}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <h2 id="interests">Interests</h2>
    </div>
    <Chips items={interests.map((interest) => interest.name)} />
  </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .avatar-box {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem;
  }

  .avatar {
    flex: none;
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .avatar img {
    display: block;
    width: 8rem;
    height: 8rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--surface0);
  }

  .avatar:global(.wiggle) {
    animation: wiggle 400ms ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes wiggle {
    25% {
      rotate: -8deg;
    }
    75% {
      rotate: 8deg;
    }
  }

  .coffee-bubble {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--mantle);
    border: 2px solid var(--peach);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    color: var(--peach);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* The bubble's tail, pointing at the avatar */
  .coffee-bubble::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: -0.6rem;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    background: var(--mantle);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--peach);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--peach);
    translate: 0 -50%;
    rotate: 45deg;
  }

  .coffee-bubble[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .avatar:global(.wiggle) {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  /* Goals sit beside the text once there is room */
  @media (min-width: 75rem) {
    .about {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, var(--reading)) minmax(0, 1fr);
      column-gap: 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
